        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>地球外部圈层</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'SimSun', 'Songti SC', serif;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            color: #000;\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 40px 20px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        p {\n            margin: 8px 0;\n        }\n        .highlight {\n            color: #e53935;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            text-decoration-color: #e53935;\n        }\n        .section-heading {\n            color: #e53935;\n            font-size: 1.25em;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        table {\n            width: 100%;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        th, td {\n            border: 1px solid #000;\n            padding: 10px 15px;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        th {\n            text-align: center;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        .col-label {\n            width: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            vertical-align: middle;\n            padding: 10px 5px;\n        }\n        .vertical-text-container {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: space-around;\n            align-items: center;\n            height: 100%;\n            min-height: 80px;\n            letter-spacing: normal;\n        }\n        .table-p {\n            margin: 6px 0;\n        }\n        .indent-p {\n            margin-left: 10px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"indent-p\">\n        <p>（2）地幔分为<span class=\"highlight\">上地幔和下地幔</span>。上地幔上部一定范围内的岩石因高温呈熔融状态，该部位被称为<span class=\"highlight\">软流层</span>，该层被认为是<span class=\"highlight\">岩浆</span>发源地。</p>\n        <p>（3）<span class=\"highlight\">地壳和软流层以上的地幔部分</span>，由<span class=\"highlight\">岩石</span>组成，统称为岩石圈。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>3.地核</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"indent-p\">\n        <p>（1）外核物质接近<span class=\"highlight\">液态</span>，主要是由铁、镍等元素组成的熔融体。</p>\n        <p>（2）内核物质可能为<span class=\"highlight\">固态</span>，刚性很强，由在极高压状态下结晶的铁镍合金组成，密度极<span class=\"highlight\">大</span>。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-heading\">二、关于“地球外部圈层”</div>\n\n    <table>\n        <tr>\n            <th style=\"width: 5%;\"></th>\n            <th style=\"width: 45%;\">特 点</th>\n            <th style=\"width: 50%;\">对地球环境的意义</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"col-label\">\n                <div class=\"vertical-text-container\">\n                    <span>大</span>\n                    <span>气</span>\n                    <span>圈</span>\n                </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">由<span class=\"highlight\">干洁空气</span>、<span class=\"highlight\">水汽</span>和微小颗粒组成：</p>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">厚度大，具有连续性；</p>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">分布不均，50%的气体集中在<span class=\"highlight\">0-6</span>千米的低空大气层（<span class=\"highlight\">对流层</span>）中。</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">大气圈能调节地球温度，避免流星体撞击地球，吸收大部分紫外线和高能带电粒子流，保护地球生命。</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"col-label\">\n                <div class=\"vertical-text-container\">\n                    <span>水</span>\n                    <span>圈</span>\n                </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">以气态、液态、固态三种形式存在于空中、地表和地下。具有连续性，分布不均，主要分布在<span class=\"highlight\">海洋</span>。是地球特有的圈层。</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">拥有水圈是地球特有的环境优势：</p>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">水圈能调节气候（降低温差）、净化大气、塑造地表形态（如<span class=\"highlight\">流水地貌</span>、<span class=\"highlight\">喀斯特地貌</span>、<span class=\"highlight\">海岸地貌</span>）；</p>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">是地球生命存在和人类延续和发展的必要条件</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"col-label\">\n                <div class=\"vertical-text-container\">\n                    <span>生</span>\n                    <span>物</span>\n                    <span>圈</span>\n                </div>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">是地球上所有<span class=\"highlight\">生物及其生存环境</span>的总称：</p>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">生物圈的核心层（生物膜）位于<span class=\"highlight\">地表以上100米到水下200米</span>的大气圈、水圈、岩石圈的交界处。</p>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">生物圈是大气圈、水圈、岩石圈长期演化、相互作用的结果；</p>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">生物圈参与对大气圈、水圈和岩石圈的改造，对地表物质循环、能量转换具有特殊作用。</p>\n                <p class=\"table-p\">生物圈是地球上最<span class=\"highlight\">大</span>的生态系统，是<span class=\"highlight\">地球</span>独有的圈层。</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <p>大气圈、水圈、生物圈、岩石圈相互<span class=\"highlight\">联系</span>、相互<span class=\"highlight\">渗透</span>、相互<span class=\"highlight\">影响</span>，形成人类赖以生存和发展的自然环境。</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
